{"id":"623007","name":"拌菠菜","author":"宁静致远0217","authorId":"9691953","desc":"","cover":"images/623007/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"半斤"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜去根泡洗干净。","img":"images/623007/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠菜捞出沥干水分，粉丝泡发。","img":"images/623007/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大蒜切碎。","img":"images/623007/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放水烧开，煮粉丝至发软捞出。","img":"images/623007/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入凉水中浸泡。","img":"images/623007/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放水烧开煮菠菜半分钟去除草酸。","img":"images/623007/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中放油炒蒜末出香味。","img":"images/623007/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"粉丝和菠菜码在碗中。","img":"images/623007/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入炒香的蒜末，辣椒油，生抽，白糖，醋拌匀即可。","img":"images/623007/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}